on><button type="button" class="housing-type-chip" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false">アパルトメント</button></div></div></div></section></div><div data-step-id="intro"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-intro"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">コメント</h2><div class="housing-field"><label for="housing-register-title" class="housing-label">タイトル</label><input id="housing-register-title" data-testid="housing-register-title-input" class="housing-input" maxlength="50" placeholder="タイトルを入力" type="text" value=""><p class="housing-address-note" data-testid="housing-register-title-remaining">残り 50 文字</p><p class="housing-address-note" data-testid="housing-register-title-optional-hint">未入力の場合、住所が表示されます</p></div><div class="housing-field"><label for="housing-desc" class="housing-label">コメント (任意・200文字まで)</label><textarea id="housing-desc" rows="4" maxlength="250" class="housing-textarea" placeholder="自由に書いてください"></textarea><p class="housing-address-note">200</p></div><div class="housing-tag-picker"><div class="housing-tag-picker-selected" aria-label="選択中"><span class="housing-tag-picker-counter">テーマを 5 件まで選べます</span></div><input placeholder="タグを検索…" class="housing-input housing-tag-picker-search" type="search" value=""><div class="housing-tag-picker-tabs" role="tablist"><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="true" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">公式</button><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="false" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">季節</button><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="false" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">テーマ</button><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="false" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">初心者</button></div><div class="housing-tag-picker-list"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">ショップ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">マネキンショップ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="fal