per-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle></svg><ol class="housing-register-stepper-list"><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-active" data-testid="housing-register-step-1" aria-current="step"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">1</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">SNS投稿・サイトから自動入力</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-1">住所が書いてあるSNS投稿やサイトのURLを貼ると、写真と住所の自動入力を試みます</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-done" data-testid="housing-register-step-2"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">2</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">住所</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-2">自動入力でも手入力でも、登録前に必ず住所を確認します</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-idle" data-testid="housing-register-step-3"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">3</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">コメント</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-3">タイトルは任意です。未入力の場合、一覧には住所が表示されます</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-done" data-testid="housing-register-step-4"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">4</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">公開設定</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-4">公開・非公開と、公開期限を選べます</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-idle" data-testid="housing-register-step-5"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">5</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">確認</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-5">入力内容をまとめて確認し、登録します</span></span></span></span></button></li></ol></div></div></nav></div><p class="housing-register-left-remaining" data-testid="housing-register-guide-remaining">本日の登録枠: 残り 3 / 5 件</p></div></section><section class="housing-register-panel" data-region="center"><div class="housing-register-col housing-register-col-center"><div class="housing-register-sections"><div class="housing-register-autosave-notice" data-testid="housing-register-autosave-notice"><div class="housing-register-autosave-notice-body"><p class="housing-register-autosave-notice-text">入力途中を復元しました</p><p class="housing-register-autosave-notice-hint">SNS 画像は再取得します</p></div><button type="button" class="housing-register-autosave-discard" data-testid="housing-register-autosave-discard">破棄する</button></div><div data-step-id="media"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-media"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">SNS投稿・サイトから自動入力</h2><p class="housing-register-image-limit-note">画像は最大10枚まで、動画は最大1本まで登録できます。</p><div class="housing-register-multi-url-field"><div class="housing-register-multi-url-row"><div class="housing-register-sns-url-field"><label for="housing-sns-url" class="housing-label">投稿・サイトのURL（任意）</label><input id="housing-sns-url" class="housing-input" autocomplete="off" placeholder="URLを貼ってください" type="url" value="https://housingsnap.com/98765"><p class="housing-register-sns-url-help">X(旧Twitter)・YouTube・ハウジングスナップなどに対応。動画付きの投稿もOKです</p><p class="housing-register-sns-url-help housing-register-sns-url-help-disclaimer">自動入力は正確でない場合があります。あくまで入力の補助としてご利用ください。</p></div></div><button type="button" class="housing-register-multi-url-add" data-testid="housing-multi-url-add">＋ URLを追加</button></div><p class="housing-register-media-success-note" data-testid="housing-register-media-success">画像を1枚取得しました</p><div class="housing-register-image-field"><label class="housing-register-image-label">取得した画像 (ドラッグで並び替え可・先頭 10 枚が保存されます)</label><ul class="housing-register-image-grid"><li style="opacity: 1; cursor: grab; transition: transform 0ms linear;" class="housing-register-image-tile" data-dragging="false" data-used="true" data-failed="false" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-roledescription="sortable" aria-describedby="DndDescribedBy-4"><img alt="" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="housing-register-image-tile-img" src="https://housingsnap.com/img/b1.jpg"><span class="housing-register-image-tile-badge">カバー</span><button type="button" class="housing-register-image-tile-remove" aria-label="削除">✕</button></li></ul><div id="DndDescribedBy-4" style="display: none;">
    To pick up a draggable item, press the space bar.
    While dragging, use the arrow keys to move the item.
    Press space again to drop the item in its new position, or press escape to cancel.
  </div><div id="DndLiveRegion-4" style="position: fixed; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 1px; height: 1px; margin: -1px; border: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(100%); white-space: nowrap;" role="status" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></div></div><button type="button" data-testid="housing-register-toggle-upload" class="housing-register-toggle-upload">画像をアップロードして登録する</button></section></div><div data-step-id="address"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-address"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">住所</h2><p class="housing-address-note" data-testid="housing-register-address-verify-note">自動入力された住所も、登録前に必ず確認してください</p><div class="housing-register-fields-grid"><div class="housing-field" data-state="auto-filled"><label for="housing-register-dc" class="housing-label">データセンター</label><select id="housing-register-dc" class="housing-input"><option value="">—</option><option value="Elemental">Elemental</option><option value="Gaia">Gaia</option><option value="Mana">Mana</option><option value="Meteor">Meteor</option><option value="Aether">Aether</option><option value="Primal">Primal</option><option value="Crystal">Crystal</option><option value="Dynamis">Dynamis</option><option value="Chaos">Chaos</option><option value="Light">Light</option><option value="Shadow">Shadow</option><option value="Materia">Materia</option><option value="Korea">韓国DC</option><option value="ChocoboCN">チョコボ (中国)</option><option value="MoogleCN">モーグリ (中国)</option><option value="FatCatCN">デブチョコボ (中国)</option><option value="MameshibaCN">マメシバ (中国)</option><option value="TW">TW</option></select><span class="housing-field-badge" data-testid="housing-auto-badge-dc" aria-hidden="true">🟡</span></div><div class="housing-field" data-state="auto-filled"><label for="housing-register-server" class="housing-label">サーバー</label><select id="housing-register-server" class="housing-input"><option value="">—</option><option value="Anima">Anima</option><option value="Asura">Asura</option><option value="Chocobo">Chocobo</option><option value="Hades">Hades</option><option value="Ixion">Ixion</option><option value="Masamune">Masamune</option><option value="Pandaemonium">Pandaemonium</option><option value="Titan">Titan</option></select><span class="housing-field-badge" data-testid="housing-auto-badge-server" aria-hidden="true">🟡</span></div><div class="housing-field" data-state="auto-filled"><label for="housing-register-area" class="housing-label">エリア</label><select id="housing-register-area" class="housing-input"><option value="">—</option><option value="Mist">ミスト・ヴィレッジ</option><option value="LavenderBeds">ラベンダーベッド</option><option value="Goblet">ゴブレットビュート</option><option value="Shirogane">シロガネ</option><option value="Empyreum">エンピレアム</option></select><span class="housing-field-badge" data-testid="housing-auto-badge-area" aria-hidden="true">🟡</span></div><div class="housing-field" data-state="auto-filled"><label for="housing-register-ward" class="housing-label">区</label><div class="housing-stepper"><input id="housing-register-ward" inputmode="numeric" class="housing-input housing-stepper-input" min="1" max="30" type="number" value="3"><span class="housing-stepper-btns" aria-hidden="true"><button type="button" class="housing-stepper-btn housing-stepper-up" data-testid="housing-register-ward-up" tabindex="-1">▲</button><button type="button" class="housing-stepper-btn housing-stepper-down" data-testid="housing-register-ward-down" tabindex="-1">▼</button></span></div><span class="housing-field-badge" data-testid="housing-auto-badge-ward" aria-hidden="true">🟡</span></div><div class="housing-field housing-field-full" data-state="auto-filled"><label class="housing-label">建物タイプ</label><div class="housing-type-selector" role="radiogroup"><button type="button" class="housing-type-chip" data-selected="true" role="radio" aria-checked="true">個人宅・FCハウス</button><button type="button" class="housing-type-chip" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false">アパルトメント</button></div></div><div class="housing-field housing-conditional-field" data-state="auto-filled"><label for="housing-register-plot" class="housing-label">番地</label><div class="housing-stepper"><input id="housing-register-plot" inputmode="numeric" class="housing-input housing-stepper-input" min="1" max="60" type="number" value="15"><span class="housing-stepper-btns" aria-hidden="true"><button type="button" class="housing-stepper-btn housing-stepper-up" data-testid="housing-register-plot-up" tabindex="-1">▲</button><button type="button" class="housing-stepper-btn housing-stepper-down" data-testid="housing-register-plot-down" tabindex="-1">▼</button></span></div><span class="housing-field-badge" data-testid="housing-auto-badge-plot" aria-hidden="true">🟡</span></div><div class="housing-field housing-conditional-field" data-state="auto-filled"><label for="housing-register-size" class="housing-label">サイズ</label><input id="housing-register-size" class="housing-input" disabled="" readonly="" type="text" value="Lハウス"><span class="housing-field-badge" data-testid="housing-auto-badge-size" aria-hidden="true">🟡</span></div><div class="housing-field housing-field-full housing-conditional-field" data-state="empty"><label class="housing-register-room-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-room-chamber-toggle" type="checkbox"><span class="housing-register-room-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-room-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>FCハウスの個室です</span></label></div></div></section></div><div data-step-id="intro"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-intro"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">コメント</h2><div class="housing-field"><label for="housing-register-title" class="housing-label">タイトル</label><input id="housing-register-title" data-testid="housing-register-title-input" class="housing-input" maxlength="50" placeholder="タイトルを入力" type="text" value=""><p class="housing-address-note" data-testid="housing-register-title-remaining">残り 50 文字</p><p class="housing-address-note" data-testid="housing-register-title-optional-hint">未入力の場合、住所が表示されます</p></div><div class="housing-field"><label for="housing-desc" class="housing-label">コメント (任意・200文字まで)</label><textarea id="housing-desc" rows="4" maxlength="250" class="housing-textarea" placeholder="自由に書いてください"></textarea><p class="housing-address-note">200</p></div><div class="housing-tag-picker"><div class="housing-tag-picker-selected" aria-label="選択中"><span class="housing-tag-picker-counter">テーマを 5 件まで選べます</span></div><input placeholder="タグを検索…" class="housing-input housing-tag-picker-search" type="search" value=""><div class="housing-tag-picker-tabs" role="tablist"><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="true" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">公式</button><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="false" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">季節</button><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="false" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">テーマ</button><button role="tab" type="button" aria-selected="false" class="housing-tag-picker-tab">初心者</button></div><div class="housing-tag-picker-list"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">ショップ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">マネキンショップ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">こだわりの内装</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">交流帳</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">酒場</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">レストラン</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">訪問歓迎</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">内装準備中</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">ロールプレイ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">水族館</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">聖堂</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">喫茶店</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">花屋</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">図書館</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">アトリエ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">銭湯</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">植物園</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">パン屋</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">音楽堂</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">イベント</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">撮影スタジオ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">ホラーハウス</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">東方様式</button></div></div></section></div><div data-step-id="visibility"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-visibility"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">公開設定</h2><div class="housing-field housing-field-full"><div class="housing-type-selector" role="radiogroup" aria-label="公開範囲"><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-public" data-selected="true" role="radio" aria-checked="true"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">探す・地図・ツアーに表示され、住所も見えます</span></button><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-unlisted" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">住所非公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">画像は探すに出ますが、住所は隠れ、ツアーには使えません</span></button><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-private" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">非公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">自分だけが見られます</span></button></div></div><div class="housing-register-promo" data-testid="housing-register-promo"><label class="housing-register-promo-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-promo-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="housing-register-promo-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-promo-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>LoPo 運営による X（Twitter）での紹介を許可する</span></label><p class="housing-register-promo-note">オンのとき、登録後に LoPo 運営が X でこのハウジングを紹介することがあります。オフにしても公開範囲や表示は変わりません。</p></div><div class="housing-register-visibility-enddate"><label class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle" type="checkbox"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>公開終了日時を設定する</span></label></div><p class="housing-register-visibility-note">公開終了日時を過ぎると、 選んだ設定に自動的に切り替わります</p></section></div><div data-step-id="confirm"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-confirm"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">確認</h2><div class="housing-register-confirm-address" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-address-gate"><div class="housing-register-confirm-address-line"><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-label">住所</span><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-value">日本 / Mana / Anima / ミスト・ヴィレッジ 3-15</span></div><p 