o" aria-checked="true"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">探す・地図・ツアーに表示され、住所も見えます</span></button><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-unlisted" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">住所非公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">画像は探すに出ますが、住所は隠れ、ツアーには使えません</span></button><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-private" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">非公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">自分だけが見られます</span></button></div></div><div class="housing-register-promo" data-testid="housing-register-promo"><label class="housing-register-promo-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-promo-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="housing-register-promo-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-promo-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>LoPo 運営による X（Twitter）での紹介を許可する</span></label><p class="housing-register-promo-note">オンのとき、登録後に LoPo 運営が X でこのハウジングを紹介することがあります。オフにしても公開範囲や表示は変わりません。</p></div><div class="housing-register-visibility-enddate"><label class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle" type="checkbox"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>公開終了日時を設定する</span></label></div><p class="housing-register-visibility-note">公開終了日時を過ぎると、 選んだ設定に自動的に切り替わります</p></section></div><div data-step-id="confirm"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-confirm"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">確認</h2><div class="housing-register-confirm-address" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-address-gate"><div class="housing-register-confirm-address-line"><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-label">住所</span><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-value"><span class="housing-register-confirm-summary-empty">未入力</span></span></div><p class="housing-register-confirm-gate-lead">住所を確認して、下のボタンを押してください</p><button type="button" class="housing-register-confirm-gate-btn" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-address-btn" data-confirmed="false" data-address-missing="true" disabled="">先に住所を入力してください</button></div><dl class="housing-register-confirm-summary"><div class="housing-register-confirm-summary-row"><dt>タイトル</dt><dd><span class="housing-register-confirm-summary-empty">未入力</span></dd></div><div class="housing-register-confirm-summary-row"><dt>SNS投稿・サイトから自動入力</dt><dd>1 枚</dd></div><div class="housing-register-confirm-summary-row"><dt>公開設定</dt><dd>公開</dd></div></dl><div class="housing-register-confirm-missing"><p class="housing-register-confirm-missing-lead">登録するには、 以下を入力してください</p><ul class="housing-register-confirm-missing-list"><li data-testid="housing-register-confirm-missing-address">住所を入力してください</li></ul></div><button type="button" class="housing-action-btn housing-btn-primary housing-register-confirm-submit" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-submit" disabled="">公開する</button></section></div></div></div></section><section class="housing-register-panel" data-region="right"><div class="housing-register-col housing-register-col-right"><div class="housing-register-check-panel" data-testid="housing-register-check-panel"><h2 class="housing-register-check-panel-title">登録前に確認</h2><ul class="housing-register-check-list"><li class="housing-register-check-row is-todo" data-testid="housing-register-check-address"><span class="housing-register-check-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠</span><span class="housing-register-check-label">住所</span></li><li class="housing-register-check-row is-todo" data-testid="housing-register-check-title"><span class="housing-register-check-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚠</span><span class="housing-register-check-label">タイトル (任意)</span></li><li class="housing-register-check-row is-done" data-testid="housing-register-check-image"><span class="housing-register-check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><span class="housing-register-check-label">画像・動画 (必須)</span></li></ul></div><div class="housing-register-dup-panel" data-state="idle" data-testid="housing-register-dup-panel"><h2 class="housing-register-dup-panel-title">重複チェック</h2><p class="housing-register-dup-quiet-text" data-testid="housing-register-dup-idle">住所を入力すると、 同じ住所の既存ハウジングを確認します</p></div><div class="housing-register-guide" data-testid="housing-register-guide"><h2 class="housing-register-guide-title">登録の流れ</h2><ol class="housing-register-guide-steps"><li class="housing-register-guide-step"><span class="housing-register-guide-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="housing-register-guide-body"><span class="housing-register-guide-step-title">画像・SNS URL を貼る</span><span class="housing-register-guide-step-desc">Twitter / YouTube の URL を貼ると、 住所や画像を自動で読み取ります</span></div></li><li class="housing-register-guide-step"><span class="housing-register-guide-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="housing-register-guide-body"><span class="housing-register-guide-step-title">住所・コメントを入力する</span><span class="housing-register-guide-step-desc">自動入力された内容を確認し、 タイトルやタグを添えます</span></div></li><li class="housing-register-guide-step"><span class="housing-register-guide-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="housing-register-guide-body"><span class="housing-register-guide-step-title">公開設定を選んで登録する</span><span class="housing-register-guide-step-desc">公開または非公開を選び、 内容を確認して登録します</span></div></li></ol></div></div></section></div></div>",
  "label": "youtube-no-address",
}
`;

