ompass-needle-n" d="M20 8 L24.5 22 L20 19 L15.5 22 Z"></path><path class="housing-tour-map-compass-needle-s" d="M20 34 L15.5 22 L20 25 L24.5 22 Z"></path><text class="housing-tour-map-compass-n" x="20" y="7">N</text></svg></div><div class="housing-tour-map-hint" data-testid="tour-map-hint" aria-hidden="true">ホイールでズーム・ドラッグで移動</div></div></div></div><div class="housing-register-guide" data-testid="housing-register-guide"><h2 class="housing-register-guide-title">登録の流れ</h2><ol class="housing-register-guide-steps"><li class="housing-register-guide-step"><span class="housing-register-guide-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="housing-register-guide-body"><span class="housing-register-guide-step-title">画像・SNS URL を貼る</span><span class="housing-register-guide-step-desc">Twitter / YouTube の URL を貼ると、 住所や画像を自動で読み取ります</span></div></li><li class="housing-register-guide-step"><span class="housing-register-guide-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="housing-register-guide-body"><span class="housing-register-guide-step-title">住所・コメントを入力する</span><span class="housing-register-guide-step-desc">自動入力された内容を確認し、 タイトルやタグを添えます</span></div></li><li class="housing-register-guide-step"><span class="housing-register-guide-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="housing-register-guide-body"><span class="housing-register-guide-step-title">公開設定を選んで登録する</span><span class="housing-register-guide-step-desc">公開または非公開を選び、 内容を確認して登録します</span></div></li></ol></div></div></section></div></div>",
  "label": "edit-initial",
}
`;

exports[`RegisterPage markupLock (分割前の記録) > edit 初期 → タイトル変更 → 保存(成功) / (失敗) 2`] = `
{
  "calls": [
    [
      "localStorage.removeItem",
      "housing-register-draft",
    ],
    [
      "canRegister",
    ],
  ],
  "html": "<div><div class="housing-register" data-testid="housing-register-form-root"><section class="housing-register-panel" data-region="left"><div class="housing-register-col housing-register-col-left"><div class="housing-register-left-scroll"><nav class="housing-register-stepper" aria-label="登録ステップ"><div class="housing-register-stepper-viewport" data-overflow="false"><div class="housing-register-stepper-body" style="transform: translateY(0px);"><svg class="housing-register-stepper-svg" data-testid="housing-register-stepper-svg" width="100%" height="0" aria-hidden="true"><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector-track" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10"></line><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector-track" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10"></line><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector-track" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10"></line><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector-track" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10"></line><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring-track" cx="21" cy="0" r="10"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring-track" cx="21" cy="0" r="10"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring-track" cx="21" cy="0" r="10"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring-track" cx="21" cy="0" r="10"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring-track" cx="21" cy="0" r="10"></circle><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10" style="stroke-dasharray: -20; stroke-dashoffset: -20;"></line><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10" style="stroke-dasharray: -20; stroke-dashoffset: -20;"></line><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10" style="stroke-dasharray: -20; stroke-dashoffset: -20;"></line><line class="housing-register-stepper-connector" x1="21" y1="10" x2="21" y2="-10" style="stroke-dasharray: -20; stroke-dashoffset: -20;"></line><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle><circle class="housing-register-stepper-ring" cx="21" cy="0" r="10" style="stroke-dasharray: 62.83185307179586; stroke-dashoffset: 62.83185307179586;"></circle></svg><ol class="housing-register-stepper-list"><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-active" data-testid="housing-register-step-1" aria-current="step"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">1</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">SNS投稿・サイトから自動入力</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-1">住所が書いてあるSNS投稿やサイトのURLを貼ると、写真と住所の自動入力を試みます</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-idle" data-testid="housing-register-step-2"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">2</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">住所</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-2">自動入力でも手入力でも、登録前に必ず住所を確認します</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-done" data-testid="housing-register-step-3"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">3</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">コメント</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-3">タイトルは任意です。未入力の場合、一覧には住所が表示されます</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-done" data-testid="housing-register-step-4"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">4</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">公開設定</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-4">公開・非公開と、公開期限を選べます</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-done" data-testid="housing-register-step-5"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">5</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">確認</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-5">入力内容をまとめて確認し、登録します</span></span></span></span></button></li></ol></div></div></nav></div><p class="housing-register-left-remaining" data-testid="housing-register-guide-remaining">本日の登録枠: 残り 3 / 5 件</p></div></section><section class="housing-register-panel" data-region="center"><div class="housing-register-col housing-register-col-center"><div class="housing-register-sections"><div data-step-id="media"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-edit-media-section"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">SNS投稿・サイトから自動入力</h2><div class="housing-edit-media-tabs" role="tablist"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="housing-edit-media-tab">アップロード</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" class="housing-edit-media-tab">URL</button></div><p class="housing-register-image-note">URLで登録すると画質が劣化しません。Twitterの場合、元の投稿を削除するとこの物件情報も自動で更新されます。</p><div class="housing-register-image-field"><p class="housing-register-image-limit-note">画像は最大10枚まで、動画は最大1本まで登録できます。</p><div class="housing-register-multi-url-field"><div class="housing-register-multi-url-row"><div class="housing-register-sns-url-field"><label for="housing-sns-url" class="housing-label">投稿・サイトのURL（任意）</label><input id="housing-sns-url" class="housing-input" autocomplete="off" placeholder="URLを貼ってください" type="url" value=""><p class="housing-register-sns-url-help">X(旧Twitter)・YouTube・ハウジングスナップなどに対応。動画付きの投稿もOKです</p><p class="housing-register-sns-url-help housing-register-sns-url-help-disclaimer">自動入力は正確でない場合があります。あくまで入力の補助としてご利用ください。</p></div></div><button type="button" class="housing-register-multi-url-add" data-testid="housing-multi-url-add">＋ URLを追加</button></div><ul class="housing-register-image-grid"><li style="opacity: 1; cursor: grab; transition: transform 0ms linear;" class="housing-register-image-tile" data-dragging="false" data-pending="false" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-roledescription="sortable" aria-describedby="DndDescribedBy-5"><img alt="" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="housing-register-image-tile-img" src="https://x/a.jpg"><span class="housing-register-image-tile-badge">カバー</span><button type="button" class="housing-register-image-tile-remove" aria-label="削除" disabled="">✕</button></li></ul><div id="DndDescribedBy-5" style="display: none;">
    To pick up a draggable item, press the space bar.
