tton type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">植物園</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">パン屋</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">音楽堂</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">イベント</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">撮影スタジオ</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">ホラーハウス</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="housing-tag-picker-option">東方様式</button></div></div></section></div><div data-step-id="visibility"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-visibility"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">公開設定</h2><div class="housing-field housing-field-full"><div class="housing-type-selector" role="radiogroup" aria-label="公開範囲"><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-public" data-selected="true" role="radio" aria-checked="true"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">探す・地図・ツアーに表示され、住所も見えます</span></button><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-unlisted" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">住所非公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">画像は探すに出ますが、住所は隠れ、ツアーには使えません</span></button><button type="button" class="housing-register-visibility-chip" data-testid="housing-register-visibility-private" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-title">非公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">自分だけが見られます</span></button></div></div><div class="housing-register-visibility-enddate"><label class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle" type="checkbox"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>公開終了日時を設定する</span></label></div><p class="housing-register-visibility-note">公開終了日時を過ぎると、 選んだ設定に自動的に切り替わります</p></section></div><div data-step-id="confirm"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-confirm"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">確認</h2><div class="housing-register-confirm-address" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-address-gate"><div class="housing-register-confirm-address-line"><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-label">住所</span><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-value">日本 / Meteor / Ramuh / ラベンダーベッド 29-3</span></div><p class="housing-register-confirm-gate-lead">住所を確認して、下のボタンを押してください</p><button type="button" class="housing-register-confirm-gate-btn" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-address-btn" data-confirmed="true" data-address-missing="false" disabled=""><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>確認済み</button></div><dl class="housing-register-confirm-summary"><div class="housing-register-confirm-summary-row"><dt>タイトル</dt><dd>変更後タイトル</dd></div><div class="housing-register-confirm-summary-row"><dt>SNS投稿・サイトから自動入力</dt><dd>1 枚</dd></div><div class="housing-register-confirm-summary-row"><dt>公開設定</dt><dd>公開</dd></div></dl><button type="button" class="housing-action-btn housing-btn-primary housing-register-confirm-submit" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-submit">保存</button></section></div></div></div></section><section class="housing-register-panel" data-region="right"><div class="housing-register-col housing-register-col-right"><div class="housing-register-check-panel" data-testid="housing-register-check-panel"><h2 class="housing-register-check-panel-title">登録前に確認</h2><ul class="housing-register-check-list"><li class="housing