ng-register-sns-url-help">X(旧Twitter)・YouTube・ハウジングスナップなどに対応。動画付きの投稿もOKです</p><p class="housing-register-sns-url-help housing-register-sns-url-help-disclaimer">自動入力は正確でない場合があります。あくまで入力の補助としてご利用ください。</p></div></div><button type="button" class="housing-register-multi-url-add" data-testid="housing-multi-url-add">＋ URLを追加</button></div><p class="housing-register-media-success-note" data-testid="housing-register-media-success">画像を1枚取得しました</p><div class="housing-register-media-video" data-testid="housing-register-media-video"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="housing-register-media-video-poster" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/p.jpg"><span class="housing-register-media-video-badge">動画あり</span></div><div class="housing-register-image-field"><label class="housing-register-image-label">取得した画像 (ドラッグで並び替え可・先頭 10 枚が保存されます)</label><ul class="housing-register-image-grid"><li style="opacity: 1; cursor: grab; transition: transform 0ms linear;" class="housing-register-image-tile" data-dragging="false" data-used="true" data-failed="false" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-roledescription="sortable" aria-describedby="DndDescribedBy-3"><img alt="" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="housing-register-image-tile-img" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/a1.jpg"><span class="housing-register-image-tile-badge">カバー</span><button type="button" class="housing-register-image-tile-remove" aria-label="削除">✕</button></li></ul><div id="DndDescribedBy-3" style="display: none;">
