ip-title">非公開</span><span class="housing-register-visibility-chip-desc">自分だけが見られます</span></button></div></div><div class="housing-register-promo" data-testid="housing-register-promo"><label class="housing-register-promo-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-promo-toggle" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="housing-register-promo-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-promo-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>LoPo 運営による X（Twitter）での紹介を許可する</span></label><p class="housing-register-promo-note">オンのとき、登録後に LoPo 運営が X でこのハウジングを紹介することがあります。オフにしても公開範囲や表示は変わりません。</p></div><div class="housing-register-visibility-enddate"><label class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle"><input data-testid="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle" type="checkbox"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-visibility-enddate-toggle-knob"></span></span><span>公開終了日時を設定する</span></label></div><p class="housing-register-visibility-note">公開終了日時を過ぎると、 選んだ設定に自動的に切り替わります</p></section></div><div data-step-id="confirm"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-confirm"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">確認</h2><div class="housing-register-confirm-address" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-address-gate"><div class="housing-register-confirm-address-line"><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-label">住所</span><span class="housing-register-confirm-address-value">日本 / Meteor / Ramuh / ラベンダーベッド 29-3</span></div><p class="housing-register-confirm-gate-lead">住所を確認して、下のボタンを押してください</p><button type="button" class="housing-register-confirm-gate-btn" data-testid="housing-register-confirm-address-btn" data-confirmed="true" data-address-missing="false" disabled=""><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>確認済み</button></div><dl class="housing-register-confirm-summary"><div class="housing-register-confirm-summary-row"><dt>タイトル</dt><dd>新しい家</dd></div><div class="ho