tepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-4">公開・非公開と、公開期限を選べます</span></span></span></span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="housing-register-stepper-item is-done" data-testid="housing-register-step-5"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num" aria-hidden="true"><span class="housing-register-stepper-num-digit">5</span><svg class="housing-register-stepper-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5L6.2 11.5L13 4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="housing-register-stepper-content"><span class="housing-register-stepper-label">確認</span><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-wrap"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc-inner"><span class="housing-register-stepper-desc" data-testid="housing-register-step-desc-5">入力内容をまとめて確認し、登録します</span></span></span></span></button></li></ol></div></div></nav></div><p class="housing-register-left-remaining" data-testid="housing-register-guide-remaining">本日の登録枠: 残り 3 / 5 件</p></div></section><section class="housing-register-panel" data-region="center"><div class="housing-register-col housing-register-col-center"><div class="housing-register-sections"><div data-step-id="media"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-media"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">SNS投稿・サイトから自動入力</h2><p class="housing-register-image-limit-note">画像は最大10枚まで、動画は最大1本まで登録できます。</p><div class="housing-register-multi-url-field"><div class="housing-register-multi-url-row"><div class="housing-register-sns-url-field"><label for="housing-sns-url" class="housing-label">投稿・サイトのURL（任意）</label><input id="housing-sns-url" class="housing-input" autocomplete="off" placeholder="URLを貼ってください" type="url" value=""><p class="housing-register-sns-url-help">X(旧Twitter)・YouTube・ハウジングスナップなどに対応。動画付きの投稿もOKです</p><p class="housing-register-sns-url-help housing-register-sns-url-help-disclaimer">自動入力は正確でない場合があります。あくまで入力の補助としてご利用ください。</p></div></div><button type="button" class="housing-register-multi-url-add" data-testid="housing-multi-url-add">＋ URLを追加</button></div><div data-testid="housing-register-image-field"><p class="housing-register-upload-warning">アップロードすると画質が圧縮されて劣化します。動画は使用できません。URLでの登録をおすすめします。</p><div class="housing-register-image-field"><label class="housing-register-image-label">画像 (任意・最大 4 枚)</label><ul class="housing-register-image-grid"><li style="opacity: 1; cursor: grab; transition: transform 0ms linear;" class="housing-register-image-tile" data-dragging="false" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-roledescription="sortable" aria-describedby="DndDescribedBy-0"><img alt="" draggable="false" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="housing-register-image-tile-img" src="blob:mock/0"><span class="housing-register-image-tile-badge">カバー</span><button type="button" class="housing-register-image-tile-remove" aria-label="削除">✕</button><span class="housing-register-image-tile-meta">800B (WEBP)</span></li></ul><div id="DndDescribedBy-0" style="display: none;">
    To pick up a draggable item, press the space bar.
