  </div><div id="DndLiveRegion-0" style="position: fixed; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 1px; height: 1px; margin: -1px; border: 0px; padding: 0px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(100%); white-space: nowrap;" role="status" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></div><div class="housing-register-image-dropzone" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="画像ファイルを選択"><input accept="image/*" multiple="" class="housing-register-image-input" tabindex="-1" type="file"><span class="housing-register-image-cta">+ 画像を追加</span><span class="housing-register-image-hint">1 / 4 枚・長辺 1920px・1 枚あたり最大 1MB に自動圧縮 (AVIF/WebP)。 ドラッグで並び替えできます (先頭が代表画像になります)</span></div></div></div></section></div><div data-step-id="address"><section class="housing-register-section" data-testid="housing-register-section-address"><h2 class="housing-register-section-title">住所</h2><p class="housing-address-note" data-testid="housing-register-address-verify-note">自動入力された住所も、登録前に必ず確認してください</p><div class="housing-register-fields-grid"><div class="housing-field" data-state="confirmed"><label for="housing-register-dc" class="housing-label">データセンター</label><select id="housing-register-dc" class="housing-input"><option value="">—</option><option value="Elemental">Elemental</option><option value="Gaia">Gaia</option><option value="Mana">Mana</option><option value="Meteor">Meteor</option><option value="Aether">Aether</option><option value="Primal">Primal</option><option value="Crystal">Crystal</option><option value="Dynamis">Dynamis</option><option value="Chaos">Chaos</option><option value="Light">Light</option><option value="Shadow">Shadow</option><option value="Materia">Materia</option><option value="Korea">韓国DC</option><option value="ChocoboCN">チョコボ (中国)</option><option value="MoogleCN">モーグリ (中国)</option><option value="FatCatCN">デブチョコボ (中国)</option><option value="MameshibaCN">マメシバ (中国)</option><option value="TW">TW</option></select></div><div class="housing-field" data-state="confirmed"><label for="housing-register-server" class="housing-label">サーバー</label><select id="housing-register-server" class="housing-input"><option value="">—</option><option value="Belias">Belias</option><option value="Mandragora">Mandragora</option><option value="Ramuh">Ramuh</option><option value="Shinryu">Shinryu</option><option value="Unicorn">Unicorn</option><option value="Valefor">Valefor</option><option value="Yojimbo">Yojimbo</option><option value="Zeromus">Zeromus</option></select></div><div class="housing-field" data-state="confirmed"><label for="housing-register-area" class="housing-label">エリア</label><select id="housing-register-area" class="housing-input"><option value="">—</option><option value="Mist">ミスト・ヴィレッジ</option><option value="LavenderBeds">ラベンダーベッド</option><option value="Goblet">ゴブレットビュート</option><option value="Shirogane">シロガネ</option><option value="Empyreum">エンピレアム</option></select></div><div class="housing-field" data-state="confirmed"><label for="housing-register-ward" class="housing-label">区</label><div class="housing-stepper"><input id="housing-register-ward" inputmode="numeric" class="housing-input housing-stepper-input" min="1" max="30" type="number" value="29"><span class="housing-stepper-btns" aria-hidden="true"><button type="button" class="housing-stepper-btn housing-stepper-up" data-testid="housing-register-ward-up" tabindex="-1">▲</button><button type="button" class="housing-stepper-btn housing-stepper-down" data-testid="housing-register-ward-down" tabindex="-1">▼</button></span></div></div><div class="housing-field housing-field-full" data-state="confirmed"><label class="housing-label">建物タイプ</label><div class="housing-type-selector" role="radiogroup"><button type="button" class="housing-type-chip" data-selected="true" role="radio" aria-checked="true">個人宅・FCハウス</button><button type="button" class="housing-type-chip" data-selected="false" role="radio" aria-checked="false">アパルトメント</button></div></div><div class="housing-field housing-conditional-field" data-state="confirmed"><